<title>Book report: Treasure Island</title>
<h>Book report: Treasure Island</h>
by <b>Bob</b>

Jim Hawkins finds a map, a ship full of pirates, and a parrot
that will not stop shouting about pieces of eight.

Best character: Long John Silver. Worst character: also Long John Silver.
